{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03869","headline":"十月乐游诗 · 郭震","name":"十月乐游诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十月严阴盛，霜气下玉台。\n罗衣羞自解，绮帐待君开。\n银箭更筹缓，金炉香气来。\n愁仍夜未几，已使炭成灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}